WEBVTT

00:00:03.235 --> 00:00:08.882
On the site, the theme shows the category and the tags of each post as badges.

00:00:08.882 --> 00:00:11.705
Each badge is a link to a term page.

00:00:12.168 --> 00:00:16.555
The Travel page lists the content categorized with Travel, newest first.

00:00:16.555 --> 00:00:19.198
Here it shows the two posts about travel.

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:24.676
Term pages are available when a taxonomy has Route contained items checked in

00:00:24.676 --> 00:00:27.947
its editor, and the theme decides how they look.

00:00:27.947 --> 00:00:30.430
A separate video covers term pages.

